This repository contains clean-room Mojo kernels and their Python and
TypeScript wrapper packages (bm25-mojo, cclib-mojo, @fuse-mojo/core). The
reference libraries they accelerate (rank_bm25, Fuse.js, cclib/PyQuante) are
used only as test and benchmark oracles and are not runtime dependencies.

Fuse.js is additionally vendored as fuse-mojo's fallback backend under its
own Apache-2.0 license; see typescript/fuse-mojo/packages/core/NOTICE.
